Name: Thinking, Fast and Slow
Author: Daniel Kahneman

This is definitely one of the books that you must read if you want to study psychology. Thinking Fast and Slow separates the human brain into 2 parts: One that thinks fast and intuitively, one that thinks slow and logically.

Recommended?
Yes. This is a must read for psychology learners. Especially if you are thinking of studying how the human brain functions.
